---
const principles = [
  { n: '01', kicker: 'It remembers.', body: 'Every clip. Until you say otherwise.' },
  { n: '02', kicker: 'It follows you.', body: 'Desktop to phone, phone to desktop. Files up to 10 MB. No cloud, no account.' },
  { n: '03', kicker: 'It respects you.', body: 'Keyboard-first. LAN-only. Open source. Free.' },
];
---
<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="kicker mono">· MANIFESTO ·</div>
    <h2>
      The clipboard is the most-used,<br />
      <span class="dim">least-respected</span> tool on your computer.
    </h2>

    <div class="cols grid-2">
      <p>
        You copy <strong>hundreds of things a day</strong>. A URL, a Slack message, an OTP code,
        a sed expression you finally got right after twenty minutes of fighting man pages.
        Then you copy one more thing — and it&apos;s all gone.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most clipboard managers are an afterthought: a daemon hidden in a tray icon with a UI that
        feels like it&apos;s personally insulting you.
        <strong> Clippy is the one that takes itself seriously.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="principles grid-3">
      {principles.map((p) => (
        <div class="principle">
          <div class="pn mono">{p.n}</div>
          <div class="pk">{p.kicker}</div>
          <div class="pb">{p.body}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .manifesto { padding: 180px 40px 140px; }
  .inner { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .kicker { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.6px; }
  .dim { color: var(--text-tertiary); }
  .cols { margin-top: 60px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; }
  .cols p { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .cols strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .principles { margin-top: 100px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
  .principle { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
  .pn { font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.4px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .pk { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.4px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .pb { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .manifesto { padding: 100px 20px 80px; } }
</style>
